        "wild": "Dinopithecus Anedmundius travels in large, hierarchical packs led by a dominant king. Individual members are skittish when alone, but a pack with their king present becomes ferociously aggressive. They are capable of flinging parasitic feces that disables Tek equipment — a unique and infuriating ability that has surprised many overconfident survivors.",
